      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this beautiful three-bedroom mid-terraced family home with a lovely low maintenance rear garden tucked away on a peaceful cul de sac to the market in the exclusive Rathlawns Development. The Rathlawns Development is located in the heart of Rathcoole and has every amenity imaginable on its doorstep. Within a stone's throw you will find local bars, shops, schools, Avoca and Rathcoole Park along with a host of bus routes, the N7 and M50 road networks, the location is truly next to none. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and well laid out living accommodation of c. 78 sqm consists of; entrance porch, hallway, living room with fireplace and fully fitted kitchen/dining area to the rear. On the first floor you have three generous bedrooms and main family bathroom. To the rear of the property you have a fully enclosed private garden of the lowest maintenance which comes with a block built shed that is great for additional storage with the use of rear laneway access also. The front couldn't be any better located on a peaceful cul de sac with no passing traffic and private off-street parking. \r\n\r\nNo.17 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners, we see this one being extremely popular with first time buyers looking to get onto the property ladder in a highly sought after area or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area, it has a list of additional features including three generous bedrooms, main family bathroom, off street parking, gas fired central heating and low maintenance rear garden to name a few! \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised. \r\n\r\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n•c 78 sqm\r\n•BER C\r\n•3 bed / 1 bath\r\n•Mid-terraced family home \r\n•Great condition throughout \r\n•Well-presented home\r\n•Spacious family home \r\n•Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n•Exclusive development \r\n•Gas fired central heating\r\n•Double glazed windows \r\n•Top quality blinds \r\n•Entrance porch \r\n•Hallway leads to all rooms \r\n•Large living room \r\n•Fireplace \r\n•Fully fitted kitchen \r\n•Open plan kitchen/dining area \r\n•Stairs & landing leads to all rooms \r\n•Three generous bedrooms \r\n•Main family bathroom \r\n•Well maintained rear garden\r\n•Private & fully enclosed \r\n•Of the lowest maintenance \r\n•Block built shed for storage \r\n•Laneway access to the rear \r\n•Private off-street parking to the front \r\n•Located on peaceful cul de sac \r\n•Heart of Rathcoole Village \r\n•Walking distance to all local amenities \r\n•Viewing highly advised \r\n•Location Location Location \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nEntering Rathcoole at the roundabout next to Avoca, continue through the village on Main Street. When you get towards the top of the village, take the left turn onto Johnstown Road. Continue straight over the mini roundabout onto School Road where you will turn right into Rathlawns and then turn right again where number 17 will be on your left."
      },
